No counterexample established. The raw maximum was \(c_{\mathrm{eff}}=2.7033\) at \(L=10\). Among 16 candidates checked through \(L=22\), the largest slope was 1.7023, falling to 1.3496 when short blocks were excluded. None yielded a reliable conformal \(c>1\).

Completed 1,338 global samples, 159 boundary samples, and 470 optimization evaluations in about 49 minutes. Not every above-one point reached \(L=22\); the cluster extension is prepared but unsubmitted.

